>\n                    <caption>共通</caption>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th style=\"width: 73%;\">項目</th>\n                            <th>重要度</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\"><a class=\"source-link3\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">小役確率</a></td>\n                            <td>★★★☆☆</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"js-menu\" style=\"display: none;\">ざっくり設定判別</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\" style=\"display: none;\">\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://media.slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/24005602/noimage1.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"js-menu\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/new-7.png\" alt=\"new\" class=\"update-icon\" data-date=\"2024-01-09\" loading=\"lazy\">ツモった際のやめ時</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\">\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3>大まかな目安</h3>\n                <div class=\"update-date\" data-date=\"2024-01-09\">2024/01/09更新</div>\n                <h4>やめ推奨時間</h4>\n                <p>2時間前の天国後やめ</p>\n                <h4>閉店欠損度</h4>\n                <p>★★★☆☆</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3>解説</h3>\n<p>2スルー以降が特に甘い機種のため、必ず天国後32Gでやめるようにしましょう。</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"js-menu\">スペック</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\">\n            <div class=\"left